    "combo1": {
      "title": "Speedroid Terrortop into M-X-Saber Invoker: Double Claudius and Heraklinos",
      "description": "A one-card line from Speedroid Terrortop, with one more card to discard to Flavian. Terrortop and Taketomborg make M-X-Saber Invoker, which brings Gladiator Beast Attorix from the Deck. Test Panther then searches Flavian - Colosseum of the Gladiator Beasts, and a Tri-Brigade engine (Arms Mouser, Kitt, Nervall, Springans Kitt, Shuraig) finds Test Bear. Test Bear summons Gistel and Noxious, which fetch Gladiator Beast's Comeback and set up Vespasius, and those become Tamer Editor. Editor brings out Claudius, and a revived Editor brings out Heraklinos. A second Claudius comes from its own summoning procedure, and Flavian Sets Gladiator Beast Charge in the End Phase. End board: two Claudius (the second can conduct your next Battle Phase twice), Heraklinos with Fraktall and three Triple Tactics Thrust in hand as discards for its negate, and Tri-Brigade Nervall. Starting hand: Speedroid Terrortop + Triple Tactics Talent + 3 Triple Tactics Thrust. The replay's Talent and Thrusts do nothing going first, so any card works as Flavian's discard.",
      "date": "September 22, 2026",
